          </h3>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/love/guides/"
          class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors"
        >
          View All Guides →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3.5">
        <a
          href="/love/guides/how-love-calculator-works/"
          class="group p-4 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200/70 dark:border-rose-800/70 bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/70 backdrop-blur-md hover:border-rose-400 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 shadow-xs space-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between transform-gpu"
        >
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <span class="text-2xl">🔬</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-rose-600 transition-colors">
              How Love Calculators Work
            </h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 line-clamp-2">
              The science, acoustic gematria, and algorithms behind name matching.
            </p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400">Read Guide →</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/love/guides/zodiac-compatibility/"
          class="group p-4 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200/70 dark:border-rose-800/70 bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/70 backdrop-blur-md hover:border-rose-400 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 shadow-xs space-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between transform-gpu"
        >
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <span class="text-2xl">✨</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-rose-600 transition-colors">
              Zodiac Compatibility Guide
            </h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 line-clamp-2">
